direction: right
title: Data Structures and Algorithms Curriculum Map

Tier1: Tier 1 Linear Foundations {
  Linear: 01. Linear Structures & Pointer Patterns
  Lists: 02. Linked Lists, Stacks & Caches
  Linear -> Lists
}

Tier2: Tier 2 Hierarchies & Search {
  Trees: 03. Trees, BSTs & Tries
  BSearch: 04. Binary Search & Divide-and-Conquer
  Trees -> BSearch
}

Tier3: Tier 3 Priority & Networks {
  Heaps: 05. Heaps, Intervals & Greedy
  Graphs: 06. Graphs & Shortest Paths
  Heaps -> Graphs
}

Tier4: Tier 4 States & Search {
  DP: 07. Dynamic Programming
  Backtrack: 08. Backtracking & Bits
  DP -> Backtrack
}

Tier1 -> Tier2 -> Tier3 -> Tier4
